### Create Job Posting
POST {{host}}/job-posting
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "title": "Ui/UX Design Intern",
  "description": "A person that will help us design some things",
  "durationInMonths": 2,
  "numberOfOpenPositions": 1,
  "expirationDate": "2024-12-10T15:53:16",
  "isCgpaRequired": false,
  "isResumeRequired": false,
  "isCoverLetterRequired": true,
  "eligibleDepartments": ["Computer Science", "Information Management Science"]
}

### Get all Job Postings
GET {{host}}/job-posting
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get Job Posting By Id
GET {{host}}/job-posting/073332ca-2549-459e-b37e-309df367bb5f
Authorization: {{token}}

### Apply to job posting
POST {{host}}/job-posting/073332ca-2549-459e-b37e-309df367bb5f/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{student_token}}

{
  "coverLetterLink": "https://www.aws_bucket.com/cover_letter",
  "cgpa": 2.8
}

### Get User's Job Posting Applications
GET {{host}}/job-posting/applications
Authorization: {{student_token}}

### Get User's Job Posting Applications
GET {{host}}/job-posting/073332ca-2549-459e-b37e-309df367bb5f/applicants
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

### Get User's Placement
GET {{host}}/placement/student
Authorization: {{student_token}}

### Approve job posting application
POST {{host}}/job-posting/34331a2a-2de2-4ce9-b5a8-63f39406249a/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}
